Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.16,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHAT MAKES A GREAT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.14,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EMPLOYEE STAND OUT?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:06.84,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,I AM DR. HYMA PRASAD,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.76,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,A PSYCHOLOGIST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:12.06,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,HOW SHOULD AN EMPLOYEE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:14.56,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,CONDUCT THEMSELVES
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:16.92,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,IN THEIR WORKPLACE?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.32,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,COMMUNICATION MUST BE CLEAR.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:22.84,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,SPEAK PROPERLY WITH EVERYONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.56,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,BE GRATEFUL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.52,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,FOR YOUR JOB.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.84,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,MANY PEOPLE DESPERATELY
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:31.96,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WANT A JOB,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:34.02,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,YET COMPLAIN ONCE HIRED.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:36.42,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DISCONTENT IS COMMON TODAY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:39.84,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,INSTEAD, THANK GOD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:42.12,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,FOR THIS OPPORTUNITY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.52,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,TREAT WORK AS WORSHIP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:46.54,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AND SHOW GRATITUDE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:48.90,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DEDICATION IS ESSENTIAL.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:52.88,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DO YOUR WORK WITHOUT DELAYS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:56.66,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,DEMONSTRATE YOUR TRUE POTENTIAL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:59.88,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AND PROVE YOUR CAPABILITY.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:02.74,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,KEEP LEARNING NEW SKILLS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:05.50,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AND PRACTICE PATIENCE.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.64,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,MENTORS MAY GET ANNOYED,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.02,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,PEOPLE HAVE MOODS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.02,0:01:13.12,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,STAY CALM AROUND THEM,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:15.72,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,ABSORB THE KNOWLEDGE,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:17.92,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AND DEVELOP YOUR SKILLS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:21.36,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHEN YOU UPSKILL YOURSELF,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.36,0:01:24.88,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,JOB PASSION NATURALLY RISES.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:27.72,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,WHATEVER YOUR JOB ROLE,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:30.62,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,NURTURING THESE HABITS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:33.36,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,SPARKS GENUINE LOVE FOR WORK.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:36.06,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,LOVE WHAT YOU DO,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:39.22,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,EMBRACE EVERY CHALLENGE,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:41.90,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,AND YOU WILL EASILY
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.90,0:01:44.90,ReelSub,,0,0,0,,REACH YOUR DREAM POSITION.
